    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite(s):</strong> Goblin, Disable Device 1 rank</p><p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You deal an extra 1d4 points of fire damage when you attack with fire from a non-magical or alchemical source (such as with torches or alchemical fire) and gain a +4 competence bonus on Reflex saving throws made to avoid catching on fire or putting yourself out when on fire. Additional damage caused by this feat does not apply to magical attacks or to splash damage.</p>",
